  "mn110:13.3": "",
  "mn110:13.4": "At <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an2.26/en/sujato'>AN 2.26</a>–29 these destinies are said to await one who hides misdeeds, who has wrong view, and who is unethical. At <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn97/en/sujato#30.3'>MN 97:30.3</a> it is said that, of the two, the animal realm is better. ",
